      "en": "that you inquire after my iniquity, and search after my sin?",
      "ko": "나의 허물을 찾으시며 나의 죄를 사실하시나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "ba37cb6fbec59c278ff87659a79b65b6174af3728e85113859d81076cb609e74",
      "translation_text_hash": "91265a51b58891fcacb61ea42405e94d2e662247af0299dd6852ab636b672505",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
