      ],
      "en": "Haven’t you poured me out like milk, and curdled me like cheese?",
      "ko": "주께서 나를 젖과 같이 쏟으셨으며 엉긴 젖처럼 엉기게 하지 아니하셨나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "a43e2f44f023e09e439e8de55b650e57e5451c705551b22dc47a3a179586947e",
      "translation_text_hash": "e26d48fb6fb865acaddabecc923ab9364f7620849a1b9d97f5b21d635d085f16",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
