      "en": "You have clothed me with skin and flesh, and knit me together with bones and sinews.",
      "ko": "가죽과 살로 내게 입히시며 뼈와 힘줄로 나를 뭉치시고",
      "source_text_hash": "4392cac9a26b274cff832aff612e716f85c710067f018c733e30fb9a5f4218b2",
      "translation_text_hash": "e1436bbd8a12a0efc646f58f9b6ae25467e692d98e3485ba150d6029a9283139",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "가죽과 살로 내게 입히시며 뼈와 힘줄로 나를 뭉치시고"
      ],
