      "en": "You have granted me life and loving kindness. Your visitation has preserved my spirit.",
      "ko": "생명과 은혜를 내게 주시고 권고하심으로 내 영을 지키셨나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "60a1b0c7623a7f32b59283ab92c4f8f46712acc3c8e75b058e00b582f76ba73e",
      "translation_text_hash": "a60da2662c8aeb6950cb700bae0e438bb312b1868249f35277df1e7430883bba",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
